WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.970
Night.

2
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.940
A tall house by a river, and a
storm hammering at its windows.

3
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:11.300
A student reads the passage and says:
"the writer makes the storm terrifying."

4
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:12.970
A big green tick.

5
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.110
Job done?

6
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.480
But then the tick starts to wobble.

7
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.560
Is agreeing with the statement
really the whole job?

8
00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:24.490
In this mission, you'll find out what
the word evaluate really asks you to do.

9
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.940
Should you disagree, just to stand out?

10
00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.330
Or say how storms make you feel?

11
00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:33.900
And you'll test one key word against
a storm from Great Expectations.

12
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:37.330
Your mission: decide
whether agreeing is enough.
